  "area": "consolidation_scheduler",
  "description": "Opt-in offline replay and consolidation scheduler. Binds NetworkModeState as the memory clock, mints cooldown-paced offline MemoryCycle nodes when default_mode_weight is high and task_demand is low, recruits the EWM background replay/consolidation/cleanup areas, and prunes completed cycles after retention.",
  "microtheory": {
    "name": "consolidation_scheduler",
    "description": "Quiet default-mode epochs schedule bounded offline episodic replay and semantic consolidation without unbounded transient growth."
  },
